# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# src/main.jsx mounts a BrowserRouter, so /entries, /reports, /settings and the
# rest are client-side paths with no file behind them. Without this rule a
# direct hit or a hard refresh on any of them returns 404 from the edge and the
# app never boots.
#
# Pages matches a real static asset before it consults this file, so the
# content-hashed files under /assets/ -- including the lazily loaded Recharts
# chunk that /reports pulls in -- are served normally and are not swallowed by
# the wildcard.
/*    /index.html   200
